โครงสร้าง Modular
```
src/
├── app.ts
├── server.ts
│
├── core/                    # Core functionality
│   ├── index.ts             # Barrel export
│   ├── config/
│   │   └── index.ts         # Environment config
│   └── types/
│       └── index.ts         # TypeScript types
│
├── plugins/                 # Fastify plugins
│   ├── index.ts             # Barrel export
│   └── socket/
│       └── index.ts         # Socket.io plugin
│
└── modules/                 # Feature modules
    ├── index.ts             # Barrel export
    ├── health/
    │   ├── index.ts
    │   └── health.route.ts
    └── notify/
        ├── index.ts
        └── notify.route.ts

```


โครงสร้าง Modularity
```
example/
 ┣ example.routes.ts
 ┣ example.schema.ts
 ┣ example.service.ts
 ┗ example.types.ts